          <span style="width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--border);"></span>
          <span>Reading Time: <strong>11 min read</strong></span>
          <span style="width: 4px; height: 4px; border-radius: 50%; background-color: var(--border);"></span>
          <span style="background: #e0f2fe; color: #0369a1; padding: 2px 10px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;">Adhesives &amp; Sealants</span>
        </div>
      </header>

      <!-- Primary Featured Image (Hero) -->
